958
01:00:53.367 --> 01:00:55.704
Huwag mo na akong itulak palayo.

959
01:00:56.244 --> 01:00:58.981
Handa akong sugurin ka kahit saan.

960
01:00:59.161 --> 01:01:00.619
Kahit sa hinaharap.

961
01:01:01.239 --> 01:01:04.931
Isinalin at binibigkas ng studio
